  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Season the chicken thighs with salt and black pepper.",
    "Dust the chicken with Japanese rice flour, shaking off any excess.",
    "In a small saucepan, combine mirin, sake, soy sauce, and brown sugar. Bring to a boil over medium heat, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the nuka-pickled daikon and whole milk.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "During the last minute of grilling, brush the chicken with the nuka-milk mixture and continue grilling until caramelized.",
    "Transfer the chicken to a serving platter and brush with the sweet soy sauce glaze.",
    "Sprinkle with green onions and ginger, and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional green onions and serve with steamed Japanese rice."
  ],
